WEBVTT

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.060
My attachment to this boy...

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.910
This is the end.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.450
A gash epposion?

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.810
A gas explosion.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:01.960
Why did he make a gash epposion?

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:03.650
I don't know.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.010
Why?!

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:06.780
I don't know.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.330
Why did this happen?

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:12.830
It's your fault, Hina!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.360
Why?!

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.170
I want to see him again!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.510
We have to get going.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.420
No, we still have time.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.710
The reception only starts in the evening.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.210
But it's already started.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.380
The people from the temple are praying for Keisei even before the ceremony.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.740
You're from Kougon, right?

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.270
Please come in.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:36.460
That's alright.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.250
I'm fine here.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.850
Don't mind us.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:41.110
Us?

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:52.140
Kagami Oori-dono.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.750
You may have seen me before.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.130
My name is Shirai Risen.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.710
I've been appointed to be this area's auditor.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.280
Auditor?

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.550
We are those who support all the priests who are fighting.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:18.170
Also, we arrange martyrs’ funerals.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:24.510
I really appreciate that you agreed with us that we held a Kougon ceremony before his all-night wakes.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.150
No.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.850
It was my brother.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:30.540
This is the funeral of my brother's other identity, right?

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:35.570
There is something you should know right away,

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:40.880
Priest Tagami couldn't become a Shikabane Hime.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.910
That means he went straight on to heaven without becoming a Corpse.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.490
He has passed away.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.990
Sometimes they get betrayed, you know?

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:55.730
By those living dead, Shikabane Hime.

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:11.750
Excuse me?

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:19.180
I am Takamine Sojo from the Kougon society.

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:22.970
That guy...

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:26.550
Keisei was my first student.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.740
In some ways he was like my son.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.820
That why I thought I should discuss something with you.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.600
About us.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:42.710
People die.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.090
But sometimes there is more to death.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:49.120
Every death is a part of our society that works and changes something in this world.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:53.270
You can also say that people become a part of this world after passing away.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.510
People have to die.

00:06:56.940 --> 00:07:00.440
But at times, beings who refuse death are born.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:06.160
They are those who die, but have still a strong attachment or some sort of fixation to this world,

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.040
and get reborn as a moving corpse.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.140
This is what we call a Corpse.

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.410
There are two elements that can be distinguished between them.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:23.750
The first one is a regeneration ability that makes them immortal.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:29.280
It also allows them to change themselves into a monstrous form.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:35.220
The other is that they believe they are still human and live among us.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:41.020
But at the same time, they have a hatred towards the living. They have no hesitation attacking.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:49.390
Corpses have superhuman strength.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.400
Besides shredding them to pieces so small they can't regenerate,

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.400
or by demolishing their brain, there is no way to kill of them.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.880
And the only ones capable to do that are the Shikabane Hime.

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:04.810
Shikabane Hime are those who've become Corpses,

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:11.930
but can fight them while being human, thanks to the teachings they've received from the Kougon.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.660
In other words, they are a secret weapon in fighting Corpses.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.090
No, that's an exaggeration, I guess.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:29.580
Every single Shikabane Hime has her own support we call a Contracted Priest.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:36.340
They provide the dead Shikabane Hime with life energy we call ‘Run'.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:39.680
But, they are also there to support them in their fight.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:45.930
Note: Reiki means aura.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:50.810
The Contracted Priest and the Shikabane Hime have a connection we call ‘En'.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:56.890
Note: Shugo means protector.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:00.510
Today there are over one hundred Contracted Priests in the whole country.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:04.230
The Contracted Priest of each area is called a Shugo.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.830
Tagami Keisei was the Shugo of this area.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.720
The highest rank in the Kougon society is the Dai Soujo.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:22.660
The one who fulfills the role below him is the Gon Dai Soujo.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:28.680
Under him are six priests that each represent a number of temples.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.070
I am one of them.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:34.690
Moreover: Gon Soujo,

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:36.380
Shou Soujo,

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.410
Gon Shou Soujo,

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:39.880
Dai Souzu.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.840
That is the ranking order.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.700
Keisei was a lower class priest.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.830
But, because he died in duty, he is granted the title of Gon Shoujo.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:54.280
It is not rare that priests die in battle.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:59.970
When the En breaks, the Shikabane Hime can't receive any further Run energy.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.770
This usually results in death.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:07.410
But sometimes there are those who survive.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:12.490
There is no other way then to dispose of those as we would any other Corpse.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.280
But, it's quite unusual that a Shikabane Hime is disposed of in those cases.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.810
All Shikabane Hime who fight hope to go on to heaven.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:54.410
It's necessary for the Shikabane Hime who are lost between life and death to defeat one hundred and eight corpses in order to be freed from their agony.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:11:02.780
When a Shikabane Hime achieves that goal, they will be freed from this world.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.050
It's not like we are using them for our own sake.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:13.360
We are saving them.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.720
I understand the Kougon society is doing a difficult job.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:28.490
Once I thought that the Kougon society was doing horrible things to the Shikabane Hime.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.590
But what should I do from now on?

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.240
I shall explain that to you.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:55.300
I will tell this to you clearly.

00:11:56.780 --> 00:12:03.150
About your situation as the new Contracted Priest of the Shikabane Hime Hoshimura Makina.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.650
New Contracted Priest?

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.000
Correct.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.870
I have already made my decision.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.560
As soon as we decide on your successor, you can end the contract with Hoshimura Makina.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.280
Hang on a moment.

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:19.140
My brother gave it to me.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:20.500
By my brother.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:29.510
You really think you will continue being her Contracted Priest?

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:31.150
Yes.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.510
You won't be able to achieve anything, even if you continue being her Contracted Priest.

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:41.590
Have you forgotten that you were about die when she extracted all your Run energy?

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:53.740
You should be happy you're still alive.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.030
In the first place, you haven’t gotten any training to be a priest.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.420
You have nothing to do with us.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.610
Where is Hoshimura-san now?

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.040
Will she come tonight?

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:10.640
She is staying with us.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:19.150
Besides, we cannot allow any of those stained ones to attend a funeral.

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:22.960
I see.

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:25.630
All of them...

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:27.830
are Shikabane Himes.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:43.630
Keisei.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.530
You're such an idiot, Keisei.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:27.860
I wasn't his real brother.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:34.960
He took me in when I was about three years old.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.520
I don't remember anything of what happened before that day.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:43.430
The thing I remember most clearly is the time I saw my little cat die.

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.070
Since that day I am filled with thoughts of death.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.580
I can't fear death.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:59.250
Strangely enough, there are some times when I feel very close to death.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:04.900
Two years ago, my whole life changed.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:15.910
My brother became the Contracted Priest of the Shikabane Hime Makina, who was the daughter of the Hoshimura family whom my brother was raised by.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:20.920
But I did not know the least about it.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:25.900
I was only worried about my brother who came home wounded from time to time.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:36.000
Soon after, I became involved in the fight between the Shikabane Himes and Corpses because of my curiosity.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:45.960
Even if those Shikabane Himes are merely living corpses, Hoshimura Makina looked like a normal girl to me.

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:51.280
But Hoshimura-san...

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:57.830
She said my brother was her fellow soldier.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.910
To her he was the most irreplaceable person.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.130
But, then I realized...

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:13.990
to Hoshimura-san, my brother was someone really special.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:27.100
That day both Hoshimura-san and I lost someone irreplaceable.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.310
Whoa! Are you going to take all of that with you?!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:51.450
It's you!

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:53.330
You put all of this in my boxes!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:56.460
Isn't your name written on it?

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:59.130
But this is your handwriting!

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.140
What the hell is this?!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.670
It's the proof of my love for you.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.530
Look at all of these Moe Senshi goods and figurines!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.630
There's more.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.360
I've even given you many items that are sold out nowadays!

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:20.270
This is me, that wants his little brother to be happy.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.470
Why don't you decorate your own room with them!?

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:23.390
Go home already!

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:26.020
Do you want to be alone already?

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:32.170
You want to have fun with all these ladies alone, huh?

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.550
Like hell I would!

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:42.010
You want to know why Makina and I fight, right?

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:48.310
Did you ever wonder what happens after you die?

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.760
Those that don't believe their deaths have a meaning, don't accept the cause...

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:59.450
those who are obsessively attached to this world, become those monsters we call Corpses.

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:03.860
Brother, if you ever get wounded badly and you...

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.130
Then please light up a candle for me.

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:11.850
What will happen to the Dairinkan if you die?!

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.990
Those kids...

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.900
What should all of us who are left behind do?

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.100
I'm sorry, Oori.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.030
I can't quit.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:27.230
Makina is the only reason why I am a Contracted Priest.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:31.560
I'm the only one she can rely on.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:45.710
The thing my brother gave me before he died was...

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.850
Yo, Oori.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:06.830
Idiot.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.290
Master?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.490
Why...

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:25.420
That clothing?

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.760
I knew your brother.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.000
Please, come inside.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.140
You too, Akira-san.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.000
I can't go in there.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.980
I'll pass too.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:45.420
Could it be that Akira-san is a Shikabane Hime?

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:47.090
Hey, master!

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:49.490
This part time worker is useless!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:51.610
Master?

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:54.350
It came back from the dead...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.310
Eh...

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:58.920
I'm sorry to interrupt.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:07.340
Could you watch over a friend for a while?

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.800
Not again.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:09.990
I'm sorry.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.280
I was lost in my thoughts.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.780
About that girl?

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:14.970
We're sorry about that.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:17.970
No.

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:22.850
She said she had to go somewhere no matter what, so we had to let her go.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:24.840
It's alright.

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:31.340
So, you are her Contracted Priest, Master?

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.200
I've been here long enough for today.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.040
See ya.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.520
Please wait.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.000
Please tell me if you are from the Kougon.

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:43.310
I want to become a Contracted Priest.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.190
No.

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:47.670
The contract has already been made.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:51.410
So I want to become worthy of being one.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.080
I don't want to give Hoshimura-san to anyone.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.090
Do you know the mountains called Goryouzan?

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:06.390
Sadahiro!

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:10.380
That's the place where all of us have trained.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:13.840
I'm sorry about what happened to Minai.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:15.720
Let's get going, Akira.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:28.550
Things once broken can't be fully repaired.

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:32.670
And still you yearn to get it back?

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:34.190
You're so desperate.

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:36.860
Can you see it?

00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:38.550
The road of light?
